@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerAuth = Basic Y3VzdG9tZXI6Y3VzdG9tZXIxMjM=
@operatorAuth = Basic b3BlcmF0b3I6b3BlcmF0b3IxMjM=
@adminAuth = Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
@sourceAccountNumber = 1000000001
@targetAccountNumber = 1000000002

### Transferencia exitosa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-transfer-success-001
X-Correlation-ID: http-transfer-success-001
X-Channel: WEB

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{sourceAccountNumber}}",
  "targetAccountNumber": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Transferencia con saldo insuficiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-transfer-insufficient-001
X-Correlation-ID: http-transfer-insufficient-001
X-Channel: WEB

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{sourceAccountNumber}}",
  "targetAccountNumber": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 999999999.00,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Transferencia idempotente - primera petición
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-transfer-idempotent-001
X-Correlation-ID: http-transfer-idempotent-001
X-Channel: WEB

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{sourceAccountNumber}}",
  "targetAccountNumber": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Transferencia idempotente - misma key y mismo body retorna la misma respuesta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-transfer-idempotent-001
X-Correlation-ID: http-transfer-idempotent-retry-001
X-Channel: WEB

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{sourceAccountNumber}}",
  "targetAccountNumber": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Conflicto de idempotencia - misma key y body diferente retorna 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-transfer-idempotent-001
X-Correlation-ID: http-transfer-conflict-001
X-Channel: WEB

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "{{sourceAccountNumber}}",
  "targetAccountNumber": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 7000.00,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Transferencia desde cuenta bloqueada
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-transfer-blocked-001
X-Correlation-ID: http-transfer-blocked-001
X-Channel: WEB

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "1000000003",
  "targetAccountNumber": "{{targetAccountNumber}}",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Consultar transferencia por referencia
# Reemplaza <transferReference> con un valor retornado por una transferencia exitosa.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers/<transferReference>
Authorization: {{customerAuth}}
X-Correlation-ID: http-get-transfer-001
